# 🎮 PRODIGY_WD_TASK3 - Neon Tic Tac Toe Game

## 📌 Project Overview

This project is **Task 3** of my **Web Development Internship at Prodigy Infotech**.

The project is an interactive **Tic Tac Toe Web Application** developed using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**.

The application allows users to play the classic Tic Tac Toe game through an interactive 3×3 game board. It includes multiple game modes, score tracking, turn indicators, winner detection, draw detection, and game reset functionality.

The project features a modern **Neon Battle Arena-inspired user interface** with a dark theme, glowing cyan accents, and purple highlights.

---

## 🎯 Task Objective

The objective of this task is to create an interactive Tic Tac Toe web application where users can:

- Play Tic Tac Toe on a 3×3 game board
- Take turns between Player X and Player O
- Interact with the game board
- Detect winning combinations
- Detect draw conditions
- Restart the game
- Track player scores

---

## ✨ Features

### 🎮 Interactive Tic Tac Toe Board

Users can interact with a 3×3 game board by clicking on the cells to make their moves.

---

### 👥 Player vs Player Mode

Two players can play against each other.

- Player 1 plays as **X**
- Player 2 plays as **O**
- Players take turns during the game

---

### 🤖 Player vs AI Mode

Users can play against an AI opponent.

The application handles the player's moves and the AI's moves dynamically.

---

### 🔄 Turn Indicator

The game displays the current player's turn.

For example:

- Player X's Turn
- Player O's Turn

This helps users understand whose turn it is during gameplay.

---

### 🏆 Winner Detection

The application automatically checks for winning combinations after every move.

Winning combinations include:

- Horizontal rows
- Vertical columns
- Diagonal combinations

Once a player wins, the game detects and displays the winner.

---

### 🤝 Draw Detection

If all cells are filled and no player has achieved a winning combination, the game detects a draw.

---

### 📊 Score Tracking

The application keeps track of the scores of both players.

- Player X Score
- Player O Score

The score updates dynamically after each game.

---

### 🆕 New Game

The **New Game** button clears the current game board and starts a new round.

---

### ♻️ Reset Score

The **Reset Score** option resets the scores of both players and allows users to start again.

---

### 🎨 Modern Neon User Interface

The project features a modern gaming-inspired interface with:

- Dark background
- Neon cyan accents
- Purple highlights
- Glowing elements
- Interactive buttons
- Smooth transitions
- Modern game-style layout

---

### 📱 Responsive Design

The application is designed to provide a good user experience across different screen sizes.

